{"id":"u-a11a9691-856f-4f1c-b37a-2532d7024079","src":"community","title":"V-Shape Foundation","author":"Baha B.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/bETAo6-fondation","desc":"A progressive 4-day training program designed to build muscle, create a wider V-shaped upper body and improve overall strength while gradually reducing body fat.\n\nThe program focuses on shoulders, back, upper chest and core while maintaining balanced leg development.\n\nWeekly structure:\n\n* Monday: Upper A\n* Tuesday: Lower A + Core\n* Wednesday: Zone 2 cardio\n* Thursday: Upper B\n* Friday: Rest / walking\n* Saturday: Lower B + Core\n* Sunday: Zone 2 cardio or recovery\n\nMain goal: improve body composition rather than simply lose weight. Progress is based on good exercise technique, progressive overload and controlled RIR.\n\nTraining principles:\n\n* Compound exercises first\n* Isolation exercises afterwards\n* 1–3 repetitions in reserve\n* Gradual increase in repetitions and weight\n* 60–180 seconds rest depending on the exercise\n* 2 Zone 2 cardio sessions per week\n\nDesigned as the foundation phase before progressing to intermediate and advanced training.","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-10-05T01:23:33.187Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Monday- Upper A","Thursday- Lower A + abdos","Wednesday- Zone 2","Tuesday- Upper B","Saturday- Lower B + abdos","Sunday- cardio"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Cable)","sets":[{"r":13,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":13,"x":3}]},{"n":"Cable Crunch","sets":[{"r":13,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Dead